# pcre2, target cross or native: the library alone, of the build machine. The cross build is for
# lfs/GLib:cross, which fetched the one of its wrap from the network without it; the native one for
# the swig of lfs/swig:native
### Not the default build: the values of package.env this target keeps or drops
PKG_DEPS=
CONF_FLAGS="--enable-unicode --enable-jit"
